What will be the output of the following recursive pseudocode for `mystery(5, 2)`?
function mystery(Integer a, Integer b)
    if (b == 0)
        return 0
    end if
    return a + mystery(a, b - 1)
end function

What will be the output of the following pseudocode for `calc(3)`?
function calc(Integer n)
    if (n <= 0)
        return 0
    end if
    return n + calc(n - 1) + calc(n - 2)
end function
